        "created_at": "2014-08-25T18:05:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hey, there are no dumb questions, right?</p><p>I'm grateful this got asked! I was having the same trouble so I came to the Internet looking for answers and here they are :)</p><p>I'm just getting everything set up and I'm pretty overwhelmed by all the new things to piece together for this game but I know once I play through it once I'll get the hang of it.</p><p>So thanks again for asking the same question I needed an answer to!&nbsp;</p>",
